# ==========================================================================
# AgentFlow backend
#
# The first section is the one that matters. Everything in it can be used to
# spend money or read the production database. A secret pushed to GitHub is
# scraped within minutes and stays in the history forever -- rotating it is
# then the only remedy -- so it must never go up at all.
#
# Railway, Render and Fly all take these as dashboard variables. None of them
# reads a .env from the repository, so committing one buys nothing.
# ==========================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

firebase-service-account.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
serviceAccountKey.json

# -- python ---------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# -- editors / os ---------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# -- local scratch --------------------------------------------------------
*.log
po_overlap_check.pdf
